  "summary": "Add hash-bound analyst dispositions and same-event rule/label comparisons with immutable alert evidence and inert HTML review.",
  "rationale": "Connects rule changes to reviewable outcomes without rewriting original detections or hiding uncertainty.",
  "limitations": [
    "Analyst names and dispositions are local assertions, not authenticated reviewers or incident verdicts.",
